    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("A three-man Jäger rifle patrol moves and acquires targets quickly, making it useful for taking empty trenches or reinforcing the front. It is less precise at long range than a British sniper team.")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("猎兵沿浅沟接近，步枪枪口避开泥水。\n三人猎兵（Jäger）巡逻队\n移动、接敌快；抢占空壕、增援前线\n中距射击准确；远射弱于英军狙击组\n机枪、装甲可阻断无掩护推进")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, keeping rifle muzzles above the water.\nThree Jäger; fast movement and target acquisition\nTake empty trenches and reinforce the front\nAccurate at medium range; less precise at range than British snipers\nMachine guns and armour halt unsupported advances")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("挑选出的步枪交给最沉稳的射手。\n一名精确射手与一名步枪观察手。优先打击机枪，转换目标后需重新瞄准；近战能力有限。")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("三人 Jäger 步枪巡逻队，移动较快，接敌迅速，适合抢占空壕、增援前线。远距离精确射击弱于英军狙击组。")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("A three-man Jäger rifle patrol moves quickly, acquires targets rapidly and can take empty trenches or reinforce the front. Less precise at long range than British sniper teams.")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("三名猎兵携 Gewehr 98 赶赴前沿。\n老练的步枪巡逻队，移动较快，接敌迅速，适合抢占空隙与补强战线。远距离精确射击逊于英军狙击组。")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("Three veteran Jäger carry Gewehr 98s to the front.\nA fast rifle patrol that acquires targets quickly, takes gaps and reinforces the line. Less precise at long range than British sniper teams.")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("挑选出的步枪守住长射界，观察手带着制式步枪警戒。精确射手优先对付机枪，转移目标需要重新稳住瞄准。\n编制：1名精确射手、1名普通步枪观察手。")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("A selected rifle for a steady shot.\nOne marksman and one rifle-armed spotter. Prioritises machine gunners and must settle after changing targets. Vulnerable at close range.")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("A selected rifle watches the long approach; a service-rifle spotter guards its flank. The marksman prioritises machine guns and must settle before changing aim.\nPair: one marksman and one service-rifle spotter.")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("猎兵小队。老兵迅速接敌，在中等距离以准确步枪火力压住暴露步兵。缺乏掩护时，难以突破机枪与装甲。")},
    {TEXT("猎兵循浅沟前进，三支步枪依次抬起。\n三人猎兵巡逻队；快速接敌，中距离准确射击\n擅长打击暴露步兵、抢占空壕；突破固定枪位须有掩护"), TEXT("The patrol follows a shallow ditch, raising three rifles in turn.\nThree veteran Jäger; rapid approach and accurate medium-range fire\nCounter exposed infantry and take vacant trenches; need cover against fixed guns"), TEXT("Jäger patrol. Veteran riflemen close rapidly and deliver accurate fire at medium range. Effective against exposed infantry; machine guns and armour halt an unsupported advance.")},
