    {TEXT("射手抵紧枪托，携弹手递来下一发。\n两人 Tankgewehr 枪组；逐发攻击车体与履带\n近距离正面入射更易击穿；大口径子弹也可击杀步兵，装填缓慢"), TEXT("The gunner braces the stock; his bearer passes another cartridge.\nTwo-man Tankgewehr crew; single shots at hulls and tracks\nClose, square impacts penetrate more reliably; also lethal to infantry, but slow to reload"), TEXT("The Tankgewehr settles onto the earth bank. Its crew fires single shots at hulls and tracks; slow loading leaves time for enemy infantry to close.\nCrew: 2 men. Close, square hits penetrate more reliably.")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("军官使附近友军命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类加成不叠加，重压制会使指挥中断。\n完成测地训练后，军官停稳 2 秒即可为可见目标校射，须有同组士兵在旁。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("The officer raises nearby accuracy by 50% and can rally troops while moving. His command area is smaller than the British officer’s; officer bonuses do not stack and heavy suppression interrupts command.\nAfter survey training, he can register artillery after a two-second halt with a companion from his section and a clear view of the target.")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。失联的枪位等着他的口令。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%；范围小于英军\n行进中重整；受重压中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同队同伴在旁、目标可见时校射")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank. Silent posts wait for his word.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%; smaller area than the British\nRallies while moving; heavy suppression breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with a section companion and clear view")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("军官握着 P08 跟上前队。附近友军得到更强指挥，行进中也能重整部队；指挥范围略小于英军，重压会中断加成。\n战术：命中率+50%，不叠加；每6秒重整。炮位测地研习后，携同伴停稳2秒可校射可见目标。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("军官随前沿队伍推进。\n近旁部队命中率提高 50%，行进中也能缓解友军压制。指挥范围小于英军；同类指挥不叠加，重压制会中断指挥。\n完成测地训练后，军官须有同伴掩护，停步观察可见目标，才能为炮兵校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("The officer advances with the leading party.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy and recover from suppression even on the move. His reach is shorter than the British officer’s. Command bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression breaks command.\nSurvey training allows a halted, escorted officer to correct artillery fire against visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("军官跟随前队，以短促口令保持队形。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%；每 6 秒重整友军，行进中仍可下令。指挥范围略小于英军，同类加成不叠加；重压会中断指挥。\n完成炮位测地研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒，可为可见目标校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("军官随前队推进，以短促口令保持队形。\n附近友军命中率提高 50%，同类指挥不叠加。每 6 秒重整友军，行进中也可下令；范围略小于英军，重压会中断指挥。\n完成炮位测地研习后，与一名同伴停稳 2 秒可为可见目标校射。")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("P08 in hand, the officer follows the advance. He gives stronger command support and can rally while moving; his reach is shorter than the British officer's, and heavy suppression breaks command.\nTactics: +50% accuracy, no stacking; rally every 6s. With battery-survey training and an escort, halt for 2s to correct visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("The officer advances with the leading men, keeping them under orders.\nNearby allies gain 50% accuracy without stacking. He rallies every 6 seconds, even while moving. His reach is shorter than the British officer's; heavy suppression breaks command.\nAfter battery-survey training, halt with an escort for 2 seconds to correct visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("军官沿壕传令，护卫在侧面警戒。\n指挥：附近命中率 +50%\n行进中重整；受重压或阵亡中断指挥\n测地训练后停稳 2 秒：同伴在旁、目标可见时校射"), TEXT("The officer passes orders along the trench while his escort guards the flank.\nCommand: nearby accuracy +50%\nRallies on the move; heavy suppression or death breaks command\nAfter survey training: halt 2 seconds with an escort and clear sight to register fire"), TEXT("The officer moves with the leading party.\nNearby troops gain 50% accuracy and rally every 6 seconds, even on the move. His command reaches less far than the British officer's. Bonuses do not stack; heavy suppression breaks command.\nWith survey training and an escort, a 2-second halt allows corrections against visible targets.")},
    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离")},
