    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也会伤及友军。正确佩戴呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。")},
    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("Gas drifts with the wind, obscuring sight and harming exposed infantry on either side. Properly fitted respirators greatly slow gas accumulation.")},
    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("风把毒云带过壕沿，警报从一个哨位传向另一个。戴面具的人只听得见自己的呼吸。\n随风漂移；遮蔽视线，杀伤双方暴露步兵\n正确佩戴防毒面具，大幅减缓毒气累积")},
    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("The cloud drifts over the trench lip; the alarm passes from post to post. The masked man hears only his own breathing.\nDrifts with wind; obscures sight and harms exposed infantry on both sides\nProperly fitted gas masks greatly slow build-up")},
    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。\n毒云随风漂移，遮蔽视线并杀伤滞留步兵，也会威胁友军。完成佩戴的呼吸器大幅减缓毒气累积。")},
    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("警铃响起，毒云顺风压向壕道。\n遮蔽视线，杀伤持续暴露的步兵，也危及友军。密封佩戴的呼吸器可大幅减缓毒气累积。")},
    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("The gas alarm sounds as the cloud drifts downwind.\nObscures sight and kills infantry that remain exposed, including allies. A sealed respirator greatly slows gas exposure.")},
    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("气弹破裂，警铃沿壕传开。毒云随风漂移，遮蔽观察并威胁久留的步兵；风也会把毒气带向友军。\n戴好呼吸器可大幅减少毒气累积。")},
    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("Gas shells burst and an alarm passes down the trench. Drifting clouds obscure sight and endanger men who remain; the wind can carry them towards friendly troops.\nA sealed respirator greatly reduces gas exposure.")},
    {TEXT("毒云越过胸墙，警报沿交通壕传开。面罩后，只听得见急促的呼吸。\n随风漂移，遮蔽视线；持续暴露杀伤双方步兵\n防毒面具减缓毒气累积；浓云中仍须尽快撤离"), TEXT("Gas passes over the parapet; an alarm travels down the communication trench. Behind the mask, a man hears his own hurried breath.\nDrifts with wind, obscures sight; sustained exposure kills infantry on either side\nMasks slow exposure; dense clouds still demand prompt withdrawal"), TEXT("Gas shells burst. An alarm passes down the trench.\nDrifting clouds obscure sight and kill infantry that remain exposed, including friendly troops. A sealed respirator greatly slows gas exposure.")},
    {TEXT("炮手压低炮口，弹丸沿前沿接连飞出。\n六发炮弹依次打击选定地域；可见装甲进入后校正落点\n杀伤弹着附近步兵，损伤车体、履带与武器；障碍物可截住弹道"), TEXT("The crew lowers the muzzle; rounds sweep along the front.\nSix shells strike the selected ground; visible armour draws corrected fire\nImpacts kill nearby infantry and damage hulls, tracks and weapons; obstacles intercept the shells"), TEXT("炮手压低炮口，弹丸沿前沿接连飞出。\n六发炮弹依次打击选定地域；可见装甲进入后校正落点\n杀伤弹着附近步兵，损伤车体、履带与武器；障碍物可截住弹道")},
